{title: Songbird}
{artist: Oasis}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G] Talking To The Song Bird Yesterday
[G]Threw Me To A Place Not Far A [Em7]Way,        [Em7]Shes A Little Violet In My Mind
[Em7]Singing Songs Of Love To Pass The [G]Time,        [G]Gonna Write A Song So She Can See
[G]Give Her All The Love She Gives To [Em7]Me
[Em7]Talk Of Better Days That Are Yet To Come,        Never Felt This Love From Any [G]One
[G]Shes Not Anyone,        Shes Not Any [Em7]One
Shes Not Any [G]One
